      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also the ability to toggle it in the safety settings in the VRC menu would be nice! ^w^\n\nBut another thing I would love to see alongside this is the ability to select what kind of device and what area the haptic feedback goes to, so devices such as bhaptics could have world integrated support... \n\nThe second part is unrealistic, I know, but I mainly think it would be nice moving forward for eventual integration with (hopefully) a larger more affordable market of haptics.",
